  "body": "## Snow CLI v0.8.34\n\n### What's New\n\n- Add decision model configuration support: configure TypeSafe System One (Jev) decision models and use them during codebase agent review to judge search-result relevance\n- Add a `/cleanup` panel for managing `~/.snow` data: clean per-project data (sessions / snapshots / history / todos / goals / teams) or global data (logs / tasks / usage / exports) older than a chosen age, with live size statistics and automatic empty-directory reclamation\n- Optimize the thinking status panel: remove the redundant glow title and skip rendering empty thinking panels\n\n### Installation\n```bash\nnpm install -g snow-ai\n```\n\n### Usage\n```bash\nsnow\n```\n### Update\n```bash\nsnow --update\n```\n"
